Saya tinggal di Kanagawa. Saya tinggal di <segment id='5' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active' correction='dengan'>apartemen enam</segment> lantai. Setiap hari <segment id='1' features='eror;leksikal;kata;prons' state='active' correction='saya'>dia</segment> bangun jam 09:00 dan sarapan jam <segment id='3' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active'>09:30.Saya</segment> <segment id='17' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbx' state='active'><segment id='6' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='17'>sergi</segment></segment> pergi ke kampus <segment id='19' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-verba;vrbx' state='active'><segment id='7' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='19'>naak</segment></segment> naik <segment id='21' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>bis</segment> dari <segment id='4' features='eror;ejaan;ejsp' state='active'>Shonandai.Dari</segment> Shonandai ke kampus SFC kira-kira setengah jam. Setiap <segment id='8' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>harı, <segment id='2' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active' parent='8'>Saya</segment></segment> pulang ke apartemen jam 20:00. Saya <segment id='9' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>makan lalu</segment> tidur jam 24:00.     </body>
